---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Berita Terkini - Desa Umbu Pabal" activePage="berita">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-surface-container-low overflow-hidden py-section-padding-mobile md:py-24 hero-pattern">
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="inline-block bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed px-4 py-1 rounded-full font-label-md mb-6 font-bold">Informasi Desa</span>
        <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl-mobile md:text-headline-xl text-primary mb-6">Kabar Desa Umbu Pabal</h1>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          Menghadirkan transparansi dan akses informasi terintegrasi bagi seluruh warga. Ikuti perkembangan terkini mengenai pembangunan, ekonomi, dan kesejahteraan masyarakat kita.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="relative flex-1 max-w-md">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-outline">search</span>
            <input 
              class="w-full pl-12 pr-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-primary transition-colors" 
              placeholder="Cari berita..." 
              type="text"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Decorative Element -->
    <div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-1/3 h-full opacity-10 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block">
      <img 
        alt="Decorative botanical illustration" 
        class="h-full w-full object-contain object-right" 
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuArdum8iYsraapIdYHiGejazocAXMLzYJmVdoV6fNZSa-spa_SN8nCn9AlJpfD_XT8Hev6QO2g5nqsHRwi7iAoMUqbu1YU5QAs6ke1NMe52F4oGVqmtmlLnwV2YaPE4Htu9R-CwhvpLBMj6cslm99DTBVP8M1iYzuB8tqeBlg2ui8RnWglahSLGHEJiwoTIRuzVJznhcSfdgz1jBhHdvGORpWu0kaSrApMU8UoIjvL4fdc-wqDFiYdOp3zpdReA-J869EbHe7OmeaQ"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- News Grid -->
  <section class="bg-surface-container-low py-12 md:py-section-padding-desktop">
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-12 gap-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mb-2">Arsip Berita</h2>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">Jelajahi informasi berdasarkan kategori yang Anda butuhkan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-2 w-full md:w-auto">
          <button class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-md whitespace-nowrap">Semua</button>
          <button class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-on-surface-variant font-label-md whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-primary-fixed transition-colors">Ekonomi</button>
          <button class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-on-surface-variant font-label-md whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-primary-fixed transition-colors">Pendidikan</button>
          <button class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-on-surface-variant font-label-md whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-primary-fixed transition-colors">Kesehatan</button>
          <button class="px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant text-on-surface-variant font-label-md whitespace-nowrap hover:bg-primary-fixed transition-colors">Infrastruktur</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              alt="Irigasi" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" 
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA3j1w_kAIkZAZNs3DjERDc1Uf58qKQv3meyvsAdPMA_HDXR-k8lrEhVqwOuiwVRA-HxwKfYwywepBo8SCZPT1yEwAbn_y4Nh1fKv5vaIwu6IQ_26-8K7orqRDNDw7ApxYW5CXAjmfc8LwdacO4vyQ7Vr-YFscfnecIHtvNF5Af5L0RdPgCyOgyRl6rKYuQLSBnPjIKOHrI-AKdv31mMVbUjOYf_ZLWeUR8EWzrrgp1Gux47LbhfwfmmJzeoc2JyeOjO4Wxq-JPKrw"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="bg-primary-container/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-primary-container text-[12px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">Infrastruktur</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md block mb-2">20 Mei 2024</span>
            <a href="/berita/pembangunan-irigasi">
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3 group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors font-bold text-lg leading-snug">Pembangunan Irigasi Baru Selesai Tepat Waktu</h3>
            </a>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-body-md mb-6 line-clamp-3">Proyek strategis pengairan sawah di wilayah Dusun Utara telah rampung, menjamin pasokan air bagi 50 hektar lahan pertanian...</p>
            <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-md group/link font-bold hover:underline" href="/berita/pembangunan-irigasi">
              Selengkapnya <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              alt="Panen Raya" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" 
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCaGnv7_fym1BQ8YP1vaU9AaP43pVHzmh4G52VFawK5Op9Dh0a3Z4UFHLN4ZR30TlUQna22j1IBTZRtWjbahqnC27Pv0RTBw2Pj6zJGserdzzp-9P9FKd-3jWB7PrwrMkGMzJ-dGF_EyWWFzzM14S8OFX5iUdypJBIb2XpZedXw8qwvbB64oh0gjq0XBuy8RIbTc-LmekUyVtU4yZtvzgYKkc_-yECvzxtuanC8NCBtYz85xnIRb47tT0SFACMAGkPXIKEmfp0Qta8"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="bg-secondary/90 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-[12px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">Ekonomi</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md block mb-2">18 Mei 2024</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3 group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors font-bold text-lg leading-snug">Panen Raya Padi Organik Meningkat 20%</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-body-md mb-6 line-clamp-3">Penggunaan pupuk organik mandiri mulai menunjukkan hasil signifikan pada hasil panen musim ini, meningkatkan kesejahteraan petani...</p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-md group/link font-bold cursor-pointer hover:underline">
              Selengkapnya <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              alt="Posyandu" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" 
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA9f5ltezy-AC2lU4q_wtmHw4GynU48GMM_WGGL26KKiQ4X2u9tYiZGjaDR3zuANnBDnrW6KfdZywlouhExcwG0ulh1GZoNOfUFxTFxfD1YObnxsu-cJbgzEWB2bys6MWOdl_BlY2T7Od_rAytjQLnyaTpfuMc_rAhJf6pSfWycbiYTjUpwxBbEXp04zSLjc40NChzCUiSiXz7Ao4c9fN-kxDDMye9dRLf6DVgxf_b9LC4TOpbuJjdlznsOlrQQoJHoEvn1YtdQdDw"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="bg-tertiary-container/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-tertiary-container text-[12px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">Kesehatan</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md block mb-2">15 Mei 2024</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3 group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors font-bold text-lg leading-snug">Jadwal Imunisasi Bulanan Posyandu Anggrek</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-body-md mb-6 line-clamp-3">Mari pastikan tumbuh kembang si buah hati dengan mengikuti jadwal imunisasi rutin yang akan dilaksanakan serentak di Balai Desa...</p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-md group/link font-bold cursor-pointer hover:underline">
              Selengkapnya <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              alt="Sekolah" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" 
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBNaSrxlQlETs0101Q2KNa65WpXED0fjDKsdjApBb4fsGO26Bd1sAE-3QjRN98aVcsYvdGkPtU-YMG_96-J4NK8AhluZ45WNVS9_spT6DC_vux2__f9GMMpocHwbveOctMFrxD-nbG-Iy74AovL17MNyMR3pKKTTJ1uz09-AgAsqk1JeGZVWk7rPgmI3IcgHwfltWwxGbmFVVixkMmzEEcLSfuiH9b5Bid8xjxbPfAZKwe-1yaMVLV-cuah01Wszbc3drGEYnuT_BM"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="bg-secondary-fixed-dim/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-secondary-fixed-variant text-[12px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">Pendidikan</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md block mb-2">12 Mei 2024</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3 group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors font-bold text-lg leading-snug">Beasiswa Berprestasi Kembali Dibuka</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-body-md mb-6 line-clamp-3">Pemerintah Desa mengalokasikan dana pendidikan bagi siswa berprestasi dari keluarga kurang mampu untuk jenjang SMA dan Kuliah...</p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-md group/link font-bold cursor-pointer hover:underline">
              Selengkapnya <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Card 5 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              alt="UMKM" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" 
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBA10VqMUYnyUvoFDF91K2itj68qLNX7Xn1ygupIcrrQ1IU53660V-r2KrHw8HP1KmZ1i68MWDFR41UiYa17Kv0jMuQmHbyROfODCbuCOQBSMvh7wFiLeXPXjHt5oAg0eq2TRiDWiTmdPnjkwQDaIsUNeooIQx70Cznu7pu7UlcLYPTemkPG2FIBBKdft-wzGAo6LWxMhReC1ORse-4q__Ns9HHwlUWeTPVNz3sVL13j7tLEKfurhFnkizt1pymR6ZVxZ1LXmwz5hM"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="bg-secondary/90 backdrop-blur-md text-white text-[12px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">Ekonomi</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md block mb-2">10 Mei 2024</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3 group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors font-bold text-lg leading-snug">Pelatihan Pemasaran Digital bagi UMKM</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-body-md mb-6 line-clamp-3">Mendorong produk lokal menjangkau pasar nasional, Desa menyelenggarakan workshop optimasi marketplace bagi pengrajin lokal...</p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-md group/link font-bold cursor-pointer hover:underline">
              Selengkapnya <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Card 6 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="h-56 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img 
              alt="Gotong Royong" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" 
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAuJi0RQPzPjnlYsUkUNZBoKI5xIR3WLD7egWN9l-oceilNdjFlwN8aUvXinppjjSxucyD1J8KLUKQe0PHUr1HoIh7PNEUvNc07t3FigHIEO270D2PFZuCiTg4obk7n33c_iPw7R6neLvLwAEVRz3n8IKRT7YJfXKW-Ivd99SmYYH9W-jnUx1g6i08q-obkzTyP0DAJfCKkl-pcKT2Fh4FUROppZVfVWRYnN7ysZdGC6Uh7MArBZ2fdy8x5fJJHPgtI7YFxqCRl5sw"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="bg-primary-container/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-primary-container text-[12px] font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-wider">Masyarakat</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant text-label-md block mb-2">08 Mei 2024</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3 group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors font-bold text-lg leading-snug">Gerakan Sabtu Bersih di Lingkungan Desa</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-body-md mb-6 line-clamp-3">Menjaga kelestarian alam dan kebersihan lingkungan, warga secara antusias mengikuti kegiatan rutin gotong royong akhir pekan...</p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-md group/link font-bold cursor-pointer hover:underline">
              Selengkapnya <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center">
        <button class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-label-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all active:scale-95">
          Muat Lebih Banyak
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    // Micro-interactions for news cards
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('.group').forEach(card => {
        card.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {
          card.style.transform = 'translateY(-4px)';
        });
        card.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
          card.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
        });
      });
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
